{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Their wealth.</b> Their property — and so ״וְעָשָׂה לִי אֶת הַחַיִל הַזֶּה״ (Deuteronomy 8), and ״וְיִשְׂרָאֵל עֹשֶׂה חָיִל״ (Numbers 24), and ״וְעָזְבוּ לַאֲחֵרִים חֵילָם״ (Psalms 49)." "<b>Captives.</b> A term of taking captive — therefore its accent is מִלְּרָע."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:05.676647198Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}